    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14633#discussion_r4262277352\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I don't think this is necessary, since this code would always run in Tokio anyway</p>\n</blockquote>",
