    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14633#discussion_r4262451001\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This is probably too long for a unit test, could we shorten the outer timeout and use the <code>set_spawned_task_shutdown_grace_period</code> with something smaller than 10s ?</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631419225,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791917491
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14633#discussion_r4262336602\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>this may panic if the task is cancelled, because of this line <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/3d5851be67f079041331b27f492ed6f561c7976e/crates/wasi/src/runtime.rs#L81\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/3d5851be67f079041331b27f492ed6f561c7976e/crates/wasi/src/runtime.rs#L81</a></p>\n<p>We should probably await the inner handle here instead</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631419226,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791917491
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14633#discussion_r4262414901\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>if <code>store.spawn</code> fails, then the task keeps running for <code>shutdown_timeout</code>, since it's already spawned at L243, which is probably not what we want.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631419227,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791917491
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14633#discussion_r4262441290\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>could we get that already on L171 avoiding a repeated <code>store.with</code>?</p>\n</blockquote>",
