    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14633#discussion_r4262381774\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This would crash the whole store, meaning all instances using this store would be aborted - I don't think that's what we want.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631419230,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
