    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14633#discussion_r4262476797\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This does not work for proxy components where the guest forwards the response body to the host unchanged. In that case the body must outlive the store.<br>\nAFAIK being able to efficiently hand over an HTTP body to the host is a desirable feature.</p>\n</blockquote>",
